  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Geneva Call is a neutral and impartial humanitarian organization      dedicated to engaging armed non-State actors towards compliance with  the norms of international humanitarian law and human rights law.     Sida is contributing to their aim through a core grant.</narrative>
